{"version":1,"content":"<p>商台叱咤頒獎禮明年1月1日舉行，距離頒獎禮尚餘2個半月，各獎項走勢亦漸見眉目，903專業推介今天（17日）公布第42周叱咤榜，泳兒《存活》成為本周冠軍歌，亦是繼《散光》後，今年第2首叱咤冠軍歌。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T10:39:08.553494+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:52:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:30:23.679513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:37:34.985778+00:00","content_hash":"c4efed2c70cbdaa0e5aeddbfaa4b2ab0c9f7018569766cdf9b0f3c38800132b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}